direction: right

*.style.border-radius: 8
*.style.font-size: 13
*.style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
*.style.stroke: "#333333"

# --- Entry ---

entry: |md
  **testability-review**
  fork · model: opus

  - test engineer
  - reviews refined
    strategy features
  - can this be validated?
| {
  shape: rectangle
  style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
  style.stroke: "#333333"
  style.stroke-width: 2
}

# --- Read inputs ---

read-inputs: |md
  **Read Inputs**

  - artifacts/strat-tasks/
  - cross-ref artifacts/rfe-tasks/
    (original acceptance criteria)
  - prior strat-reviews/
    if re-review
| {
  shape: rectangle
  style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
  style.stroke: "#333333"
  style.stroke-width: 2
}

# --- Assess (LLM) ---

assess: |md
  **Assess Testability**
  LLM (opus)

  - acceptance criteria testable?
  - success criteria measurable
    (baseline)?
  - missing edge cases (failure,
    boundaries, concurrency,
    scale, backwards-compat)?
  - test strategy? NFRs testable
    (perf / scale / security)?
| {
  shape: rectangle
  style.fill: "#e8e8e8"
  style.stroke: "#333333"
  style.stroke-width: 2
  style.double-border: true
}

# --- Decision ---

verdict-q: |md
  **Recommendation**

  approve /
  revise criteria /
  add test plan
| {
  shape: diamond
  style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
  style.stroke: "#333333"
  style.stroke-width: 2
}

# --- Result ---

result: |md
  **STRAT-NNN assessment**

  - testability
  - missing edge cases
  - untestable criteria
  - test complexity
  - recommendation (+ concrete
    rewrites for vague criteria)
| {
  shape: rectangle
  style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
  style.stroke: "#333333"
  style.stroke-width: 2
}

# --- Flow ---

entry -> read-inputs
read-inputs -> assess
assess -> verdict-q
verdict-q -> result
